{"seq":2,"slug":"period-close-reconcile","title":"对账期与关账流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/ledger-query-period-close/period-close-reconcile","wordCount":2036,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"对账期与关账流程\">对账期与关账流程</h1><p>账本按时间切成一段一段，每一段叫一个会计期间（period）。关账（period close）是这个切分动作：在一段时间上跑完全部校验，通过后把它锁住，此后不再接受新的过账。关账的价值不是&quot;管理上的仪式感&quot;，而是<strong>它让&quot;这段账的数字已经确认&quot;成为一句可验证的话</strong>。没有关账的账本，任何时候的报表都只是&quot;目前看起来是这样&quot;，没人能对任何数字负责。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-期间是一等对象\">核心概念：期间是一等对象</h2><p>期间不是查询时的一个时间过滤条件，而是账本里的一等实体。它有自己的状态、自己的校验清单、自己的锁。这个定位带来一个直接的设计后果：<strong>过账时必须携带 <code>period_key</code>，并在入库前校验该期间未锁定</strong>。如果期间只是查询条件，过账就无法被拦住——分录落库时根本不知道它属于哪个期间。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>FROZEN</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>CHECKED</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>CLOSED</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>REOPENED</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = (\\text{FROZEN}, \\text{CHECKED}, \\text{CLOSED}, \\text{REOPENED})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FROZEN</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CHECKED</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLOSED</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">REOPENED</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四个状态的语义如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>允许新过账</th>\n<th>允许调整已有关账数据</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OPEN</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>期间进行中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FROZEN</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>期末处理开始（快照、重估）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLOSED</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否（须受控重开）</td>\n<td>全部校验通过并留档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REOPENED</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（有限）</td>\n<td>发现错账、经审批重开</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>FROZEN 是一个容易被忽略但必要的中间态。期末处理要连续做几件事（冻结过账 → 生成快照 → 跑重估 → 试算平衡），这几件事之间不能再有新分录进来，否则快照与重估的基准不一致。因此需要一个&quot;只锁写、但还没最终确认&quot;的状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; OPEN: 期间开始&#10;  OPEN --&gt; FROZEN: 期末处理开始&#10;  FROZEN --&gt; OPEN: 校验失败,回退排查&#10;  FROZEN --&gt; CLOSED: 全部校验通过 + 留档&#10;  CLOSED --&gt; REOPENED: 审批通过 + 记录原因&#10;  REOPENED --&gt; CLOSED: 调整完成 + 重新校验\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; OPEN: 期间开始\n  OPEN --&gt; FROZEN: 期末处理开始\n  FROZEN --&gt; OPEN: 校验失败,回退排查\n  FROZEN --&gt; CLOSED: 全部校验通过 + 留档\n  CLOSED --&gt; REOPENED: 审批通过 + 记录原因\n  REOPENED --&gt; CLOSED: 调整完成 + 重新校验</pre><h2 id=\"期间表的数据模型\">期间表的数据模型</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE accounting_period (&#10;  period_key    INT          PRIMARY KEY,          -- 202609&#10;  period_type   VARCHAR(8)   NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;MONTH&#39;,&#10;  start_date    DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  end_date      DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  status        VARCHAR(12)  NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;OPEN&#39;&#10;                CHECK (status IN (&#39;OPEN&#39;,&#39;FROZEN&#39;,&#39;CLOSED&#39;,&#39;REOPENED&#39;)),&#10;  frozen_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  closed_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  closed_by     VARCHAR(64),&#10;  reopen_reason TEXT,&#10;  reopen_count  INT          NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  check_report  JSONB,                             -- 关账校验结果快照&#10;  CHECK (end_date &gt;= start_date)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_period_open ON accounting_period(period_type)&#10;  WHERE status IN (&#39;OPEN&#39;,&#39;FROZEN&#39;,&#39;REOPENED&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> accounting_period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_key    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 202609</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MONTH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  start_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  end_date      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OPEN'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OPEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLOSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REOPENED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  frozen_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_by     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reopen_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reopen_count  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  check_report  JSONB,                             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 关账校验结果快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (end_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> start_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_period_open</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounting_period(period_type)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OPEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REOPENED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后那条<strong>偏唯一索引</strong>是这张表的灵魂：它保证同一类型（如月度）下<strong>同时最多只有一个未关闭期间</strong>。这条约束拦住的是一类真实事故——人为跳期，即 9 月还没关就开了 10 月的期间，导致两个期间同时接受过账，跨期分录的归属彻底混乱。数据库层的这条约束比任何流程文档都可靠。</p>\n<p><code>reopen_count</code> 记录重开次数。重开本身不是错误，但<strong>反复重开说明关账前的校验不充分</strong>——这个计数是流程健康度的度量，值持续增长时应当回头收紧校验清单而不是加快重开审批。</p>\n<h3 id=\"过账前置校验\">过账前置校验</h3><p>期间锁的强制点在过账路径上，且必须与分录插入在同一事务内：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 过账事务内的期间锁校验（在插入 journal_entry 之前执行）&#10;SELECT 1&#10;  FROM accounting_period&#10; WHERE period_key = :period_key&#10;   AND status = &#39;OPEN&#39;&#10; FOR SHARE;      -- 共享锁：阻止并发关账在本事务提交前锁定期间\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 过账事务内的期间锁校验（在插入 journal_entry 之前执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounting_period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> period_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OPEN'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SHARE;      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 共享锁：阻止并发关账在本事务提交前锁定期间</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>FOR SHARE</code> 是这里的关键。不加锁会有竞态：过账事务读到 <code>OPEN</code>，然后关账事务把它改成 <code>FROZEN</code> 并提交，过账事务才提交分录——于是一条分录落进了已冻结的期间。共享锁让关账的 <code>UPDATE</code> 必须等待正在进行的过账事务结束，语义正确。代价是关账时需要检查并等待在途过账，实务上做法是先切状态为 FROZEN（阻止新过账开始），再等待在途事务排空，然后才做快照与重估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关账检查清单\">关账检查清单</h2><p>关账不是一个动作，是一份有序的检查清单。每一项失败都必须阻断关账，而不是记录警告后继续——<strong>带缺陷关账等于把缺陷固化进历史</strong>，后续只能通过重开修复，代价高得多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"七个检查项\">七个检查项</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>失败含义</th>\n<th>修复方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>在途过账排空</td>\n<td>有事务未完成</td>\n<td>等待或终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>无未过账草稿</td>\n<td>DRAFT/PENDING 分录残留</td>\n<td>过账或作废</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>期间增量试算平衡</td>\n<td>本期分录被破坏</td>\n<td>定位并红冲修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>全量试算平衡</td>\n<td>全局不一致</td>\n<td>定位分歧源头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>余额快照校验</td>\n<td>快照 ≠ 增量之和</td>\n<td>重生成快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>外币重估完成</td>\n<td>汇率敞口未处理</td>\n<td>执行重估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>关联业务单闭环</td>\n<td>有单据未到终态</td>\n<td>业务侧推进</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第 7 项常被技术团队忽略但业务上很重要：如果本期内有订单处于&quot;支付成功但未清算&quot;的中间态，关账会把一个未完成的业务固化成历史。因此关账清单里要有业务闭环检查，而它往往需要业务侧的配合（推进或标记为异常挂账）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"检查清单的实现\">检查清单的实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 关账前置检查（整体）：返回全部未通过项，任一项非空则阻断&#10;WITH checks AS (&#10;  SELECT &#39;unposted_drafts&#39; AS check_name, COUNT(*) AS failures&#10;    FROM journal_entry&#10;   WHERE period_key = :period_key AND entry_type LIKE &#39;%DRAFT%&#39;&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT &#39;unbalanced_period&#39;, COUNT(*)&#10;    FROM (&#10;      SELECT l.currency&#10;        FROM journal_line l JOIN journal_entry e USING (entry_id)&#10;       WHERE e.period_key = :period_key&#10;       GROUP BY l.currency&#10;      HAVING SUM(CASE l.direction WHEN &#39;DR&#39; THEN l.orig_amount ELSE -l.orig_amount END) &lt;&gt; 0&#10;    ) t&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT &#39;snapshot_mismatch&#39;, COUNT(*)&#10;    FROM (&#10;      SELECT s.account_id&#10;        FROM balance_snapshot s&#10;        JOIN account_balance b ON b.account_id = s.account_id&#10;       WHERE s.as_of = :period_end_date&#10;         AND s.posted_orig &lt;&gt; b.posted_orig&#10;    ) t&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT &#39;fx_revaluation_pending&#39;, COUNT(*)&#10;    FROM account a JOIN account_balance b USING (account_id)&#10;   WHERE a.currency &lt;&gt; :functional_currency&#10;     AND b.posted_orig &lt;&gt; 0&#10;     AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;       SELECT 1 FROM journal_entry e&#10;        WHERE e.period_key = :period_key AND e.entry_type = &#39;REVALUATION&#39;)&#10;)&#10;SELECT check_name, failures FROM checks WHERE failures &gt; 0;&#10;-- 返回空集 = 全部通过，可以关账\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 关账前置检查（整体）：返回全部未通过项，任一项非空则阻断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unposted_drafts'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> check_name, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> failures</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> period_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '%DRAFT%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unbalanced_period'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orig_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orig_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'snapshot_mismatch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance_snapshot s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_balance b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">as_of</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_end_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_orig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_orig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fx_revaluation_pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_balance b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (account_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :functional_currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_orig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REVALUATION'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> check_name, failures </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> failures </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回空集 = 全部通过，可以关账</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个&quot;返回全部失败项&quot;的设计比&quot;逐项检查、遇错抛出&quot;更好用：运维一次就能看到所有问题，不必修一个跑一次。检查结果要写进 <code>check_report</code> 字段留档，它是审计时&quot;你凭什么说这个期间是干净的&quot;的直接证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关账后的调整路径\">关账后的调整路径</h2><p>关账之后发现问题，只有两条路，选哪条取决于差错的性质。</p>\n<h3 id=\"路径一-下期调整-默认\">路径一：下期调整（默认）</h3><p>绝大多数差错用下期调整即可解决：在当前（未关账）期间记一笔调整分录，业务引用指向原始业务，<code>entry_type</code> 标为调整类型。原期间的数字不变，调整的影响体现在当期。这是 <a href=\"../double-entry-posting/immutable-posting-reversal\">不可变过账与红冲</a> 里&quot;跨期间红冲&quot;的标准做法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 下期调整：调整分录落在当期，标注所冲的历史期间&#10;INSERT INTO journal_entry (entry_id, biz_ref, entry_type, posted_at, period_key, currency)&#10;VALUES (&#39;E20261015003&#39;, &#39;ORDER-99120&#39;, &#39;ADJUSTMENT_PRIOR_PERIOD&#39;,&#10;        &#39;2026-10-15T10:00:00Z&#39;, 202610, &#39;CNY&#39;);&#10;-- 并在分录元数据中记录原期间，供报表附注引用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 下期调整：调整分录落在当期，标注所冲的历史期间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry (entry_id, biz_ref, entry_type, posted_at, period_key, currency)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20261015003'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ORDER-99120'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ADJUSTMENT_PRIOR_PERIOD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '2026-10-15T10:00:00Z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">202610</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 并在分录元数据中记录原期间，供报表附注引用</span></span></code></pre></div><p>&quot;下期调整&quot;的代价是当期报表会出现一笔不属于本期的业务影响。会计上这是常规操作（称前期差错更正），但<strong>必须让当期报表的使用者知道</strong>，否则他们会把这笔波动当成本期经营结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"路径二-受控重开-例外\">路径二：受控重开（例外）</h3><p>只有两种情形值得重开已关账期间：一是差错金额重大到扭曲原期间财务报表；二是法定或监管要求原期间必须准确（比如已报送的税务报表需要更正）。重开必须有：审批人、原因文本、影响范围评估、以及一个明确的关闭期限。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 受控重开：记录审批与原因，并递增计数&#10;UPDATE accounting_period&#10;   SET status        = &#39;REOPENED&#39;,&#10;       reopen_reason = :reason,&#10;       reopen_count  = reopen_count + 1&#10; WHERE period_key = :period_key&#10;   AND status = &#39;CLOSED&#39;&#10;   AND :approved = TRUE;    -- 审批标志来自工作流，不由调用方自由传入\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 受控重开：记录审批与原因，并递增计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounting_period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REOPENED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       reopen_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :reason,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       reopen_count  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reopen_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> period_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CLOSED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :approved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE;    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 审批标志来自工作流，不由调用方自由传入</span></span></code></pre></div><p>重开期间的过账必须<strong>限制在调整类分录</strong>，不能开放普通业务过账——否则重开就成了&quot;把门打开&quot;，历史期间的稳定性荡然无存。实现上是在过账校验里加一条：<code>status = &#39;REOPENED&#39;</code> 的期间只接受 <code>entry_type IN (&#39;ADJUSTMENT&#39;, &#39;REVALUATION&#39;)</code> 的分录。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>下期调整</th>\n<th>受控重开</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原期间报表</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>变更并重新发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批要求</td>\n<td>无（常规操作）</td>\n<td>必须有审批与原因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>影响披露</td>\n<td>当期报表附注</td>\n<td>原期间报表附注 + 更正说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>绝大多数差错</td>\n<td>重大差错、法定要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（历史被改写）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"期间与分区的对应关系\">期间与分区的对应关系</h2><p><code>period_key</code> 同时是 <a href=\"../double-entry-posting/posting-idempotent-batch\">入账幂等与批量过账</a> 里的分区键。这个复用是有意的：分区边界与关账边界对齐后，<strong>归档一个期间就是归档一个分区</strong>，操作简单且不会切到未关账的数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按期间分区，分区边界与会计期间一一对应&#10;CREATE TABLE journal_entry (&#10;  entry_id   VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL,&#10;  period_key INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  posted_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (period_key, entry_id)&#10;) PARTITION BY RANGE (period_key);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE journal_entry_202609 PARTITION OF journal_entry&#10;  FOR VALUES FROM (202609) TO (202610);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按期间分区，分区边界与会计期间一一对应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> journal_entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  posted_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (period_key, entry_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RANGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (period_key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> journal_entry_202609</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF journal_entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">202609</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">202610</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对齐带来的一个附带好处是<strong>归档的策略可以跟关账状态绑定</strong>：只归档 <code>status = &#39;CLOSED&#39;</code> 且超过留存热期的分区。这个规则天然保证不会把还在调整的期间归档走，见 <a href=\"ledger-audit-retention-report\">审计留存与报表</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>关账给账本的时间轴加上刻度，让&quot;某段账已经确认&quot;成为可验证的陈述。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>期间是一等实体</strong>，有状态与锁；过账必须携带 <code>period_key</code> 并在事务内校验期间未锁定。</li>\n<li><strong>FROZEN 是必要中间态</strong>，只锁写、未确认，让期末处理各步骤有稳定的基准。</li>\n<li><strong>偏唯一索引保证同时只有一个未关闭期间</strong>，用数据库约束拦住人为跳期。</li>\n<li><strong>过账校验用 <code>FOR SHARE</code></strong>，与关账的 <code>UPDATE</code> 形成正确的互斥，避免分录落进已冻结期间。</li>\n<li><strong>关账检查清单七项全部阻断式</strong>，任一项失败即拒绝，检查报告留档作为审计证据。</li>\n<li><strong>关账后只有两条路</strong>：默认下期调整（低风险），例外受控重开（需审批、限调整类分录、记录原因）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>账本被切段并锁定后，最后一个问题是：凭什么让审计相信这段账没被动过，见 <a href=\"ledger-audit-retention-report\">审计留存与报表</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"对账期与关账流程","id":"对账期与关账流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：期间是一等对象","id":"核心概念-期间是一等对象"},{"level":2,"text":"期间表的数据模型","id":"期间表的数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"过账前置校验","id":"过账前置校验"},{"level":2,"text":"关账检查清单","id":"关账检查清单"},{"level":3,"text":"七个检查项","id":"七个检查项"},{"level":3,"text":"检查清单的实现","id":"检查清单的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"关账后的调整路径","id":"关账后的调整路径"},{"level":3,"text":"路径一：下期调整（默认）","id":"路径一-下期调整-默认"},{"level":3,"text":"路径二：受控重开（例外）","id":"路径二-受控重开-例外"},{"level":2,"text":"期间与分区的对应关系","id":"期间与分区的对应关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"账目溯源与账户流水","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/ledger-query-period-close/ledger-trace-flow-query"},"next":{"title":"审计留存与报表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/ledger-query-period-close/ledger-audit-retention-report"}}